{"item_uid": "指考94-biology-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "biology", "subject_zh": "生物", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "行為學家發現有一種蟑螂的生物鐘是以 25 小時為一週期，這種蟑螂利用黎明天色由暗變亮作為週期歸\n零的機制，以維持其晝伏夜出的習性。如果將這種蟑螂在某天的黎明時分開始關入暗室(暗室內有蟑螂\n看不到的紅光以供觀察其行為)，則幾日後蟑螂的作息將會晝夜顛倒？", "options": {"A": "1日", "B": "6日", "C": "12日", "D": "24日"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 8.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 56.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 23.0, "p_value": 44.0, "p_high": 56.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 47.0, 41.0, 37.0, 31.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
